      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. You mentioned Marcus and Andre lean toward \"Street Hustler\" and would fit better in a crime drama. Do you think that's because of their specific backgrounds/vibe, or is it just the standard way those types of characters are written in Hollywood? Like, if I swapped their names or descriptions but kept the same energy, would they still feel like they belong in a crime setting?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
